damaged ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996000/extras/enGIF3.gif?t=1745202656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Engage in strategic real-time tower defense challenges. Deploy a variety of unique towers and utilize the island\u2019s diverse terrains like jungles, deserts, canyons, and labyrinths for effective defenses. Battle alien creatures hidden throughout the wilderness in fast-paced encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996000/extras/enGIF4.gif?t=1745202656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a town filled with devout followers, elusive monsters, cryptic notes, eerie underground chambers, and blood-stained rituals, each contributing to a hidden narrative. As clues are pieced together, a shadowy past begins to surface, revealing the island\u2019s most guarded and unsettling mysteries.</p>","developers":["\u6e38\u4e50\u574a"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996000/1c19cff1df2ed7f361df2aa38186bd7b803c2da8/header.jpg?t=1745202656","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127046,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127046/movie480.mp4?t=1744857936","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127046/movie_max.mp4?t=1744857936"},"name":"\u53d1\u552e\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247\uff08\u82f1\u6587\uff09","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127046/e26f764f840936ebf93228b3da1e9bf108c776e2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744857936","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstat